<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 80 0 R
/T (Nassau Candy Distributor. The project converts raw order and shipment records into logistics intelligence by measuring shipping lead time, route volume, geographic performance, factory contribution, and ship mode behavior. The work combines spreadsheet review, Python programming, statistical preparation, visualization, and interactive web application development. Because the available project documentation describes the analytical workflow but does not include the final aggregated numeric results, this paper explains the analysis framework and the business meaning of each measure without inventing unsupported values. The resulting process can be reused whenever the cleaned dataset is available.)
/E (Nassau Candy Distributor. The project converts raw order and shipment records into logistics intelligence by measuring shipping lead time, route volume, geographic performance, factory contribution, and ship mode behavior. The work combines spreadsheet review, Python programming, statistical preparation, visualization, and interactive web application development. Because the available project documentation describes the analytical workflow but does not include the final aggregated numeric results, this paper explains the analysis framework and the business meaning of each measure without inventing unsupported values. The resulting process can be reused whenever the cleaned dataset is available.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [13]
>>
