157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 83 0 R
/T (A cleaned dataset improves trust in every later result. If states are written in multiple formats, the same location may be counted as separate states. If dates are stored as text, monthly trends may be sorted alphabetically rather than chronologically. If duplicate rows remain, route volume and revenue may be overstated. These problems are not merely technical; they can lead directly to poor operational decisions.)
/E (A cleaned dataset improves trust in every later result. If states are written in multiple formats, the same location may be counted as separate states. If dates are stored as text, monthly trends may be sorted alphabetically rather than chronologically. If duplicate rows remain, route volume and revenue may be overstated. These problems are not merely technical; they can lead directly to poor operational decisions.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
