/T (Conclusion This project establishes a complete data-driven framework for understanding factory-to-customer shipping efficiency at Nassau Candy Distributor. Through cleaning, feature engineering, EDA, route aggregation, geographic analysis, and dashboard development, raw data becomes a practical decision-support resource. The combined use of Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Excel, VS Code, and Streamlit supports both technical reproducibility and business usability.)
/E (Conclusion This project establishes a complete data-driven framework for understanding factory-to-customer shipping efficiency at Nassau Candy Distributor. Through cleaning, feature engineering, EDA, route aggregation, geographic analysis, and dashboard development, raw data becomes a practical decision-support resource. The combined use of Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Excel, VS Code, and Streamlit supports both technical reproducibility and business usability.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
