/T (count, exact calculated averages, threshold value, route leaderboard, or dashboard screenshots. Therefore, this paper explains the analytical design and defensible interpretation without fabricating numerical findings. Final numeric claims should be inserted after running the completed notebook or Streamlit application on the source dataset. Route efficiency is also influenced by factors that may not exist in the dataset, such as carrier identity, transportation distance, weather, warehouse processing time, holidays, and customer priority. The analysis should therefore be interpreted as operational evidence from shipment records, not as proof of a single causal factor.)
